ily:arial,sans-serif;line-height:16px;opacity:1;word-wrap:break-word;word-break:break-word;color:rgb(38,50,56)\"><span dir=\"ltr\">int variable contained non-int values; processing stage=data initialization; variable name=gap_lengths; base type=int</span></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>The data passed to the model looks like this:</div><div><div>print(stan_data[&#39;N_gaps&#39;])</div><div>0</div><div>print(stan_data[&#39;gap_heights&#39;])</div><div>[]</div><div>print(type(stan_data[&#39;gap_heights&#39;]))</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-size:14px;line-height:inherit;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(0,0,0);border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:baseline\">&lt;class &#39;list&#39;&gt;</pre></div><div>print(stan_data[&#39;gap_lengths&#39;])</div><div>[]</div><div>print(type(stan_data[&#39;gap_lengths&#39;]))</div></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;font-size:14px;line-height:inherit;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;color:rgb(0,0,0);border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:baseline\"><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;line-height:inherit;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap;vertical-align:baseline\">&lt;class &#39;list&#39;&gt;\r\n</pre><div><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">Is this expected behavior?</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">If this is expected behavior, I can change the variable gap_lengths to real, but I need to use those numbers to do indexing later. Thus, they need to be ints. How can I convert an array of reals to an array of ints?</div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">Thanks!</div></pre></div>"
